  "rule": "sliderLayout",
  "description": "How many activity-days the slider's window holds at width (CSS px or dp left for \u00ab track \u00bb), and whether \u00ab \u00bb show: always with a fine pointer (finePointer, a mouse or trackpad), otherwise only when the track still holds 12 days beside them. 18 a day, 7 to 31 days.",
